  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.35 Self-directed study program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.35 “Self-directed study program” means a program that is presented via audio, video, or computer programming at a time chosen by the licensee, which requires successful completion of an examination to obtain proof of completing the self-study program.\n\nSource. #14135, eff 12-1-24",
